Package: demogfit
Type: Package
Title: Blockwise Composite-Likelihood Demographic Inference for Species Pairs
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("Leeban", "Yusuf", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "example@example.com")
Description: Fits closed-form Wilkinson-Herbots (2008, 2012) blockwise
    composite-likelihood models (Strict Isolation, Isolation-with-Migration,
    Isolation-with-Initial-Migration, and Secondary Contact) to the
    blockwise pairwise-mutation-count distribution derived from a gIMble
    blockwise site-frequency spectrum (bSFS). Provides per-model fitting
    functions with user-specifiable parameter bounds, and a master function
    that fits multiple models per species pair and reports which model is
    best supported (or, at minimum, whether there is evidence for gene flow
    via a Strict-Isolation-vs-Isolation-with-Migration comparison).
